OL,3,GNEWSABurst pipe shuts schools and      
OL,4,Adisrupts supplies                      
OL,6,FThree schools have closed and water    
OL,7,Fsupplies to homes and businesses are   
OL,8,Fbeing disrupted after a water main     
OL,9,Fburst in Sherborne.                    
OL,11,FThe burst is affecting the DT9 postcode
OL,12,Farea, causing low water pressure or no 
OL,13,Fsupply. Wessex Water has apologised and
OL,14,Fsaid teams were on site carrying out   
OL,15,Furgent repairs.                        
OL,17,FThe firm added it was trying to move   
OL,18,Fwater around the network to keep as    
OL,19,Fmany homes connected as possible and   
OL,20,Fwould be in touch with those registered
OL,21,Fon its priority service to deliver     
OL,22,Fbottled water if needed.               
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
