OL,3,GNEWSABurst pipe shuts schools and      
OL,4,Adisrupts supplies                      
OL,6,FDorset Council said Harbour Vale       
OL,7,FSchool, Sherborne Primary School and   
OL,8,FThe Gryphon School were closed.        
